      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not explicitly define “birth rate” as “the frequency of births in a population or region during a given time period,” nor does it state this as the meaning of the term.",
        "The definition’s mention of “educational” and “urbanization” and “age-structure factors” being influences is only indirectly supported by the listed influencing factors (e.g., female illiteracy rate, urbanization rate, dependency ratios) and not clearly supported as a general statement that birth rate is “influenced by” those categories in the specified way.",
